# Render outputs; the source is everything else. This example commits its source clip (clip.mp4), its transcript and
# its review sheets (board.png and contact.png), and leaves out vo.wav: tools/clip.mjs prepare makes it from clip.mp4.
out/
stills/
board.md
brand.png
vo.wav
node_modules/

# Secrets: an --env-file kept in the piece (API keys) must never be committed.
.env
*.env
.env.*
